WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.978
Don't know what to say? Let it ask you.

2
00:00:05.278 --> 00:00:10.067
Tap today's question, or pick a topic with Ask me about.

3
00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:15.695
Hit record and answer. Tap Next question when you're ready.

4
00:00:17.395 --> 00:00:22.295
We open one present each on Christmas Eve, right at midnight.

5
00:00:23.495 --> 00:00:28.345
At a friend's house when I was nine. They thought it was so strange.

6
00:00:29.545 --> 00:00:32.545
Every year. Even now.

7
00:00:33.345 --> 00:00:38.557
Afterwards, each question sits in your transcript, right above what you said.
